# The fetched dashboard artifact.
#
# 160 files and 8 MB, produced by upstream's own release workflow. Committing it
# would put hashed filenames in every diff, make the repository's size a function
# of someone else's release cadence, and leave no way to tell which version a
# checkout carries except by reading it back out of the bundle.
#
# `scripts/fetch-metacubexd.sh` reproduces it. `UPSTREAM_VERSION` *is* tracked, so
# a checkout states which version it expects and an upgrade shows up as a
# one-line change. `cargo build` works without the artifact and serves a
# placeholder page explaining how to fetch it.
dist/

# Per-fetch detail — file count, size, source URL. Useful next to the artifact,
# meaningless without it.
artifact.toml
